  "july": "The served PDF is effective July 7, 2026. It covers these July 12-16 games. Main-tour maker-fee changes are dated November 15, 2025; no subsequent tennis changes returned. Challenger and ITF schedules have no returned changes and use PDF defaults. The exact rounding implementation on July 1-6 is not independently archived here.",
  "rounding": "Official API fee-rounding documentation distinguishes direct-member 0.01-cent balance precision and non-direct-member 1-cent precision. One-contract integer-cent fills: charge formula rounded up to that precision. Reports supply both scenarios; no account rebate, membership or FCM charge is inferred.",
  "ruler": "Gross corrected W1 close minus entry is preserved. Add entry fee and fee-adjusted marked-to-W1-close value. Marking to close is not an executed exit: no exit fee or liquidity is invented."
